<!-- Original MIT Project Prime entity definitions; no third-party game data. -->
<classes><group name="func_group" color="0.5 0.7 0.9">Prime geometry identity container. Keep exactly one brush, patch or mesh per container. Preserve its ID and metadata; review changes in Studio.<string key="prime_geometry" name="Prime geometry container marker" value="1" /><string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime geometry GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing primitive.</string><string key="prime_patch_solid" name="Prime patch collision" /><integer key="prime_patch_tessellation" name="Prime patch tessellation" /></group><group name="worldspawn" color="0.5 0.5 0.5">World brush, patch and mesh geometry. New primitives receive durable IDs when saved. Review changes in Studio before applying.</group><point name="info_player_start" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Neutral spawn. Team and hunter policy stays in the native Prime project for geometry-only editing.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><angle key="angle" name="Facing" value="0" /></point><point name="info_player_deathmatch" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Neutral spawn. Team and hunter policy stays in the native Prime project for geometry-only editing.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><angle key="angle" name="Facing" value="0" /></point><point name="weapon_railgun" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_rocketlauncher" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_lightning" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_plasmagun" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_shotgun" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><point name="weapon_grenadelauncher" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">Canonical Quake-to-Prime pickup mapping. Geometry-only edits retain native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></poi