native pickup policy.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><integer key="prime_spawn_interval" name="Respawn simulation frames" value="300" /><string key="prime_has_base" name="Has base" value="true" /></point><group name="trigger_push" color="0.6 0.2 1">BSP reference import only; direct editable import rejects new trigger entities. Existing Prime traversal remains in the native project.<target key="target" name="Destination target" /></group><group name="trigger_teleport" color="0.6 0.2 1">BSP reference import only; direct editable import rejects new trigger entities. Existing Prime traversal remains in the native project.<target key="target" name="Destination target" /></group><point name="target_position" color="0.2 0.8 0.4" box="-16 -16 -24 16 16 32">BSP reference traversal destination; direct editable import does not add traversal targets.<string key="prime_id" name="Stable Prime object GUID">Preserve this ID when editing an existing object.</string><targetname key="targetname" name="Target name" /></point>
<!-- Prime native gameplay contract. Positions use Quake world coordinates; directions have axis rotation only. -->
